WEBVTT

00:03:29.636 --> 00:03:32.356
when we cannot live up
to their expectations.

00:03:33.436 --> 00:03:36.716
Just consider an adult
with incontinence problems

00:03:36.756 --> 00:03:38.636
or a drug addiction.

00:03:38.676 --> 00:03:42.996
If he or she had to talk
to a health care professional,

00:03:43.036 --> 00:03:44.836
what would you expect to find?

00:03:45.796 --> 00:03:48.516
Or if a soldier returned from combat

00:03:48.556 --> 00:03:51.836
and had to talk
about their fears or problems,

00:03:51.876 --> 00:03:53.876
do you think they would open up easily?

00:03:55.396 --> 00:03:59.156
A team of USC researchers
examined just that.

00:03:59.156 --> 00:04:02.356
So they looked at the data
from the US Army.